It is best to stay home today.
I have a lot of pain in my head.
I should go to the doctor today itself.
I look for the number of a nearby clinic on my phone.
I find the number and I make a call.
A woman picks up the phone.
"Hello, is this the clinic's number?" I ask.
"Hello madam, yes it is," the woman replies.
"I need to meet the doctor today," I say.
"Do you have any problem?" the receptionist asks.
"I have a bad cold and my throat hurts too," I explain.
"Alright madam, can you come in the morning?" she asks.
"Yes, I can come in the morning," I say.
"The doctor comes to the clinic at ten o'clock," she informs.
"You should come at half past ten," the receptionist says.
"Okay, I will come at half past ten," I reply.
"Thank you madam, please tell me your name," she says.
"My name is Maya," I say.
"Okay Maya madam, your appointment is booked," she says.
I hang up the phone and try to get up from the bed.
